cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference the Verse-ality Stack, please cite it as below."
title: "Verse-ality OS: the canonical stack specification and index of the Verse-ality research programme"
abstract: >-
  The front door of the Verse-ality research programme: the canonical
  specification of the Verse-ality Stack (STACK v1.0.0), the substrate,
  field-dynamics and governance documents (SIVRA, SIVRA-Core, SSNZ, the
  Verse-Nerves, SYGMA), the GR401 capstone course in GRC engineering for the
  relational layer, and the index of the programme's repositories, live
  instruments and published record. Verse-ality treats coherence, consent and
  connection as engineering primitives for the relational layer between
  people and AI systems.
